ay-mid leading-relaxed mb-12">Pain guides, placement science, aftercare protocols. Everything your artist should tell you but probably won&#x27;t.</p></div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red border-b border-transparent hover:border-brand-red transition-all pb-1 w-fit" href="/first-tattoo">Start Here →</a></div><div class="p-10 border-r border-b border-gray-light bg-white hover:bg-off-white transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between"><div><div class="text-brand-red mb-8"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="20" stroke-linecap="square"></rect><path d="M8 8H4M16 8H20"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4 leading-tight">Planning Your Next Piece</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-12">Browse designs by meaning, style, and placement. Build your consultation collection.</p></div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red border-b border-transparent hover:border-brand-red transition-all pb-1 w-fit" href="/gallery">Browse Designs →</a></div><div class="p-10 border-r border-b border-gray-light bg-white hover:bg-off-white transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between"><div><div class="text-brand-red mb-8"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke-linecap="square"></circle><path d="M12 7V17M7 12H17" stroke-linecap="square"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4 leading-tight">Understanding the Meaning</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-12">The symbolism, cultural origin, and significance behind every design. Meaning documented for every design in our library.</p></div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red border-b border-transparent hover:border-brand-red transition-all pb-1 w-fit" href="