h="400" height="533" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-contain p-4 bg-white border-b border-gray-light" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="p-8"><h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4 uppercase">split tiger and hannya mask</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-3">This design illustrates the &#x27;beast within,&#x27; juxtaposing the domestic familiar cat with the Hannya mask, which symbolizes jealous rage and demonic transformation in Japanese folklore. It suggests a hidden depth of ferocity and supernatural protection lurking beneath a calm exterior. The fragmentation of the mask around the central feline face represents a psychic shattering or the breaking of a social veneer.</p><div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red mb-6">This design is a modern Neo-Japanese interpretation of traditional Irezumi motifs, specifically the Hannya mask from Noh theater.</div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-brand-red hover:border-brand-red transition-all" href="/gallery/split-tiger-and-hannya-mask">Read Full Story</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col bg-white border border-gray-light"><img alt="skeletal court jester holding a smiling mask with eight-ball charms" loading="lazy" width="400" height="533" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-contain p-4 bg-white border-b border-gray-light" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="p-8"><h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4 uppercase">skeletal court jester holding a smiling mask with eight-ball charms</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-3">This design represents the &#x27;Danse Macabre&#x27; or the Dance of Death, signifying the mockery of mortality and the idea that death is the ultimate equalizer regardless of social status. The jester specifically symbolizes the subversion of reality, while the mask and skeletal reveal highlight the duality between the personas we project and the inevitable decay beneath. The incorporation of 8-balls suggests a fatalistic view of luck and the finality of life&#x27;s game.</p><div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red mb-6">Late Medieval European &#x27;Danse Macabre&#x27; traditions blended with contemporary Dark Illustrative tattoo aesthetics.</div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-brand-red hover:border-brand-red transition-all" href="/gallery/skeletal-court-jester-holding-a">Read Full Story</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col bg-white border border-gray-light"><img alt="Japanese samurai cat with kabuto and katana" loading="lazy" width="400" height="533" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-contain p-4 bg-white border-b border-gray-light" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="p-8"><h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4 uppercase">Japanese samurai cat with kabuto and katana</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-3">This design represents the &#x27;Neko-Samurai,&#x27; blending the protective, cunning nature of the cat with the Bushido code of honor and resilience. The inclusion of the Daruma doll at the base signifies unyielding perseverance—specifically the &#x27;fall seven times, stand up eight&#x27; philosophy—while the cherry blossoms symbolize the ephemeral nature of life. It serves as a talisman for a warrior&#x27;s spirit that remains playful yet disciplined in the face of transience.</p><div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red mb-6">Japanese Neo-Traditional (Modern Irezumi) drawing from Edo-period ukiyo-e aesthetics and folklore.</div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-brand-red hover:border-brand-red transition-all" href="/gallery/japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto">Read Full Story</a></div></div></div><div class="w-full text-center font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-mid">MEANING DOCUMENTED FOR EVERY DESIGN IN OUR LIBRARY</div></section><section class="py-24 px-8 lg:px-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-24 border-b border-gray-light items-center"><div><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-brand-red uppercase tracking-[0.3em] block mb-6">FEATURE</span><h2 class="font-display text-[48px] md:text-[60px] leading-[1] mb-8 uppercase tracking-tighter">SEE IT ON YOUR SKIN