order-r-0 border-gray-light"><div class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-4 text-black">14</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-red mb-8">CRITICAL DAYS</div><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-mid">The first 14 days determine whether your tattoo design holds its precision for decades or fades within a year.</p></div><div class="p-12 bg-white border-r last:border-r-0 border-gray-light"><div class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-4 text-black">60%</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-red mb-8">OF LOTIONS</div><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-mid">Contain compounds that accelerate ink migration in the dermis during the healing phase. Most artists never mention this.</p></div><div class="p-12 bg-white border-r last:border-r-0 border-gray-light"><div class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-4 text-black">5×</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-red mb-8">FASTER FADE</div><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-mid">Tattoos on high-friction placements fade 5× faster than the same design on optimal placements.</p></div></div><div class="mt-16 flex justify-center"><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-brand-red hover:border-brand-red transition-all" href="/blog">READ THE COMPLETE AFTERCARE SCIENCE GUIDE</a></div></section><section class="py-24 px-8 lg:px-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-24 border-b border-gray-light bg-white"><div><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-brand-red uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-6 block font-bold">DIRECT ARTIST BOOKING</span><h2 class="font-display text-[48px] md:text-[60px] leading-[1] mb-8 uppercase tracking-tighter">VERIFIED ARTISTS.<br/><span class="text-gray-mid">DIRECT BOOKING.</span></h2><p class="text-[18px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed max-w-[480px] mb-12">Discover verified tattoo artists on TattoosMap. Bro